      "writtenOn": "2019-05-06T14:44:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes that is correct, due to the __packed attribute on p256_int, and yes, I believe we could also solve this by casting to uint32_t*, but given how critical this is, and the fact that it fails silently if something goes wrong, I thought it was perhaps better to make it totally explicit, to avoid any regressions should any future compiler decide to do something strange (not that I would expect it to, but still..)\n\nAgree it looks a little odd though, definitely happy to defer to other\u0027s judgement as to the most appropriate fix.",
